<title>USA: Intel sets dates for 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Intel sets dates for 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CLARA, Calif. 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Intel Corp on Wednesday said it would pay a two-for-one stock split on July 13 to shareholders of record on June 10.</p>
<p>The stock split was announced on January 14.</p>
</text>
